sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Server

    User->>Browser: Type a new note
    User->>Browser: Click "Save"

    Note over Browser: JavaScript intercepts the form submission

    Browser->>Browser: Create note object
    Browser->>Browser: Add note to local notes array
    Browser->>Browser: Re-render notes list

    Browser->>Server: POST /new_note_spa\nContent-Type: application/json\n{"content":"New note","date":"..."}
    activate Server
    Server-->>Browser: HTTP 201 Created
    deactivate Server

    Note over Browser: No page reload occurs
